General


* **Minimum distance (separation):**

$$
d_{\min}(C_i, C_j) = \min_{x \in C_i, \, y \in C_j} d(x,y)
$$

* **Maximum distance:**

$$
d_{\max}(C_i, C_j) = \max_{x \in C_i, \, y \in C_j} d(x,y)
$$

* **Average distance:**

$$
d_{\text{avg}}(C_i, C_j) = \frac{1}{n_i n_j} \sum_{x \in C_i} \sum_{y \in C_j} d(x,y)
$$

where $n_i = |C_i|$.

